1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,568
Buying one A.I. image means a signup and a card on file.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,876
Gliana Agent. Pay per result, from your own wallet.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,392
The home screen is a map, drawn by the product itself.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:16,264
Point the phone at something. On a phone, the camera is the prompt.

5
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,128
Today's quest leads: your machine, transformed into a robot.

6
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:29,456
The exact price comes first. Four point eight cents, quoted before anything runs.

7
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,288
One approval, signed in Seed Vault.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:41,264
And the photograph comes back transformed. Same table, same curtain, same cable. You paid for it, you own it.

9
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,716
Now stake it. One global round a day, on Solana mainnet.

10
00:00:53,500 --> 00:01:00,196
Entry is five S.K.R., or four if you hold a hundred, and that discount is read from your token account on chain.

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,632
The wallet shows the same numbers.

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,080
You are in. The pot is nineteen S.K.R., held by the round's own vault.

13
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:19,104
Four machines transformed. A fan, a rice cooker, a motorbike, and yours.

14
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,584
Voting is free. One per wallet, enforced by whether a program account exists.

15
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:34,412
Payouts are permissionless. The pot pays out even if we disappear.

16
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,568
It is live on the Solana dApp Store today.
